& [SemanticConflictAudit] confirms source selection
  + quiescent_double_inventory grammatically asserts or strongly suggests a quiescent state
  + two equal non-atomic acquisitions establish only equality at the two observation boundaries
  + transient change-and-restore is not denied
  + post-second-acquisition change is not denied
  + external-writer absence is not denied
  + the prior formation correctly denied atomic snapshot meaning but did not remove the remaining quiescence inflation
  + a machine token is part of the public contract and cannot be weakened by contradictory documentation
  + source revision is required and already preserved; no correction to the new source is needed

& [EvidenceLatticeAudit] passes
  + supplied pair Equal remains below physical repeated acquisition evidence
  + non_atomic_repeated_inventory_equal requires two actual complete acquisitions, temporal order, exact common scope, and equal commitments
  + supervisor-quiesced evidence is not introduced because its writer and enforcement model is incomplete
  + os_snapshot_proven remains reserved and stronger
  + neither pure enum validity nor caller construction proves producer authority
  + no automatic promotion edge exists

& [TypeAndFieldAudit] passes
  + InventoryConsistencyEvidence names evidence rather than candidate state
  + NonAtomicRepeatedInventoryEqual is compositional and denies atomicity directly in its token
  + consistency_evidence names the receipt field as an evidence grade
  + removing ConsistencyClass avoids retaining the ambiguous public type through an alias
  + exact snake_case serde preserves inspectability
  + two closed variants are sufficient for current and reserved meanings

& [ProfileAudit] requires explicit revision
  + phase3 machine forms changes public enum machine meaning and therefore moves 0.1 to 0.2
  + topology forms changes its imported vocabulary and therefore moves 0.2 to 0.3
  + topology receipt changes field and value tokens and therefore moves 0.2 to 0.3
  + scanner profile stays 0.1 because no physical implementation or scan-policy behavior is changed
  + old profiles must fail revised exact validation

& [LegacyAudit] passes strict replacement
  + no persisted topology receipt, physical producer, ledger, mutation consumer, or external API exists
  + strict deny-unknown-fields already rejects old consistency when consistency_evidence is required
  + serde closed enum rejection covers quiescent_double_inventory
  + no migration, alias, default, fallback, or compatibility shim is justified
  + historical source and evidence remain immutable historical records

& [ReceiptInvariantAudit] closes unintended change
  + scanner profile, candidate root, strong root identity, canonical volume-GUID syntax, admission profile and digest, policy digest, scan nonce, ordered inventory digest, limits, counts, totals, and issue-expiry relations remain unchanged
  + only receipt profile, field name, field type, allowed value, fault field, and exact message change
  + TopologyReceipt remains a pure caller-constructible form and never becomes proof issuance
  + OsSnapshotProven must be rejected by receipt validation until its provenance fields exist

